POST http://localhost:5157/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Garren",
  "email": "garren@example.com",
  "password": "secure_password"
}

### Log a New Expense
POST http://localhost:5157/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "amount": 150.50,
  "category": "Food",
  "description": "Weekly grocery run",
  "date": "2026-07-14T11:00:00Z"
}

### Get All Expenses for User 1
GET http://localhost:5157/api/expenses/user/1

### Set a Budget for Food
POST http://localhost:5157/api/budgets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "category": "Food",
  "limit": 3000.00
}

### Get All Budgets for User 1
GET http://localhost:5157/api/budgets/user/1